;    3: TDecorate(count=254, unk2=11195903, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=1225, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=54, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=38, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=8, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=18, unk2=65280, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=は, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=むち, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=5224, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=4772, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>! Please wake up!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Suddenly a loud voice sounded right by my ear, and my mind slipped back to reality.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "1000"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島考える32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Something terrible's happened! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> are gone!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Just then, my mind was muddled.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The line between dream and reality had blurred, and it took me time to understand what </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was saying.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I had apparently been sleeping in the living room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A dim light was coming in from outside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was already morning.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"The two of them are gone...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes, I woke up a little while ago and went into their room to check on them, and they were both...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ホラー.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Finally realizing how serious this was, I hurried to get up too.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "1000"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンション寝室.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others had slept in a room with one bed and two pillows lying side by side.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There was no doubt that </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had been here.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "1000"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島横顔32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I'll check the recordings from this building's security cameras."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> turned on the living room TV and put the security camera channel up on it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The building's residents could apparently view the security camera footage freely.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Or maybe only </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> room was special...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, by the look of her, was going to need time to find the footage she wanted.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In the meantime, I tried to think whether anything came to mind.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "1000"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">But―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My mind couldn't help drifting back to the dream from earlier.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "1000"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\中央公園\御神木足跡なし.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I have never had prophetic dreams or precognitive dreams, or any dream of that kind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So I think that dream, too, came from the impressions of these past few days being far too vivid, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Something about the four of us being shut inside a giant cherry tree forever, or whatever it was...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "1000"}
{CREATECG "222" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\菌糸動き.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "540" "600" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n222\r\n4\r\n0\r\n8000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Bound all over by something growing from the ground, rope or vine, I couldn't tell...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it... I feel like </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said something at the end.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Natsumi's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> words... what were they?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Wasn't it the goddess's name, if I remember right?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島横顔32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111,222" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
<STYLE ID="4">"Found it! There they are!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> shouted, her eyes still on the TV.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At her call, I turned my eyes to the TV too.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\渦巻くシナプス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "モニターノイズ.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションエントランスインターホン.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\春花白装束バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―The time was around 6:30 a.m.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Just 10 minutes or so before, two people passing through the building's entrance.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Dressed in white, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and in ordinary clothes, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">The two of them seemed to walk out of the building without the slightest hesitation.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">From there </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> fast-forwarded the recording, but after that no one appeared at the entrance.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In other words, the two of them were still out there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If I remembered right, the special unit sent by the government was supposed to come today.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If the two of them ran into them―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">If, as we first suspected, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is a pawn of the goshinboku, the special unit and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> will end up enemies, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I may be overthinking it after all, but just in case, I'd better find out where the two of them are headed.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島横顔32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'm going out. It's dangerous to leave those two outside like this, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I'm sorry, I can't leave this place, so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But I'll look for any information that might help. Please be especially careful today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But before that, there's one thing I want to confirm."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What is it?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I went through the trial records of the old Megasawa City case and so on, just to be sure. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Going back over what you said yesterday, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, there was something off in bits and pieces of what you said that I just couldn't shake. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">So while we're at it, I'll ask you straight out."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"The one behind the Megasawa City case... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">who was it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I'm certain you were at the scene of the first Megasawa City case, at least. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But as far as I remember, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you've never once said 'I did it myself.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\警笛とざわめき_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Also, the method of the first case bothers me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Even with Droga, a couple in their 30s with no combat experience whatsoever hit the target's vital spot precisely, in a single blow. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">On top of that, it called for a route out of sight that even a professional would have to rehearse many times. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">That seems like too much of a stretch."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"The second and third cases are the same. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">They're methods that would be impossible without considerable knowledge of human anatomy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Surely you weren't studying up in advance, expecting </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> to call on you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"These contradictions tie in with the fact that the state has a fair grasp of the truth behind this earthquake disaster. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Any suspects who seem to know even a little of the truth have to be cut off from society. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">In case word of Droga ever spread to the general public."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"That's why you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, were forcibly cut off from society as a lifer. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">As far as the trial records show, there was no mention of Droga at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And at first, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you insisted on a full acquittal, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I have to go look for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and the others."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, the reason you kept quiet about it right up until your arrest in the Motoki-cho case was so that </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">your husband, Ryoji-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, wouldn't bear the responsibility alone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Ryoji-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> couldn't be left to dirty his hands alone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">So you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, went on acting as if you were the one who did it too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"But once </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ryoji-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> passed away, there was no need for that anymore. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Still, my guess is that </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ryoji-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> wasn't the one who did it in the first place either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Even if that's so, what difference can it make now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I'll file a petition for a retrial, and I'll take the witness stand myself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Now that this disaster has happened, I don't think even the government can keep Droga hidden. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Right now is exactly our chance."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you're as sharp as ever. If that works, I might be released."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"If I can come back with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I may lean on you then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"O-of course."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Well then, I'm off."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes! I'll get you out too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I promise!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow2.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\市街地災害後3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―7 a.m.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The cherry blossoms were still falling, and the road was dyed pink.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Today was even colder than yesterday.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">White breath leaked out between my chattering teeth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'd thought I was bundled up plenty, but the liquid clinging to my feet chilled them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It had rained yesterday, so the footing was all the worse.</STYLE><PG>
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "700" "10000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">The special unit was supposed to arrive early this morning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If it was early morning, they might well be here already.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But whether they had any intention of rescuing survivors...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">From what the Chief Cabinet Secretary said, they had already written off survivors on their own.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">In that case, we have no choice but to get out of here on our own.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Natsumi's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> car would let us escape anytime, but that would mean leaving </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> to die.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> really does expose the truth of the Megasawa City case, I might be released too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Not just for emotional reasons: I absolutely have to get </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> out too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">But anyone who learns about this phenomenon gets killed, as in the Nanashina Incident.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Whether that's the Arata cherry's doing or this so-called government conspiracy, I don't know.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At the very least, the special unit should have gear that lets them survive even in this air.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Which means...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">If I could get my hands on the special unit's gear, I could get </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> out right away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But could someone like me really do such a thing?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Steal their gear without the special unit finding me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">As long as they're in Motoki City, they won't take their gear off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Negotiating is probably impossible too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So the only way is to kill the special unit...?</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">―!!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This is...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\警笛とざわめき_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\タイヤの跡1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Tire tracks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Still fresh.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">They couldn't have been more than an hour old.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Were they the special unit's, or from </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> driving?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">But these rugged tire tracks didn't look like they came from an ordinary car.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I decided to follow the tracks without letting anyone see me.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow2.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">I didn't know which way the vehicles had gone, but for now I headed toward the outskirts.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Judging by the tracks, at least three vehicles had come.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So they were cars carrying people from outside after all, not </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Probably 10 to 15 of them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Most likely the special unit, I think.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I'd meant to look for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others at first, but before I knew it my heart had turned toward the special unit.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, that wasn't it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others had vanished, and I thought that might have something to do with this special unit showing up. That was why.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In other words, if I followed these tire tracks, where </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others had gone would come into view on its own.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That was how it felt.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Today I'm acting on vague judgments like 'I have a feeling' or 'it's probably so.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Is it because of that dream?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Because of that dream, my senses―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">my intuition has grown sharp.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Of course it isn't precognition like </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, but I have a strange premonition.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Whether to believe it is up to me, but in spite of that doubt, my feet are following the tires.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My reason may have doubts, but by instinct I'm following my intuition.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Besides, talking with </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> earlier, I saw a light in my future.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'm in high spirits from that too, and it seems to be making me bolder.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―How long had I walked?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\タイヤの跡2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Leaving the city center behind, I came to the road where the prison bus that had carried me was.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">From here it was uphill the whole way, and getting to where the prison bus was would still take several hours.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Not that the prison bus was my destination...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">My back hurt from walking with my eyes on the ground for 30 minutes or so.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'm getting old after all...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">As time went by, these tire tracks would fade from sight too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">From here on it was basically a single road, so I could follow it to some extent, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Was there another unit up ahead? Or maybe </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I sat down on a rock in the shade of a tree.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">When I let out a big sigh, my white breath </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="は">crawled</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> over the ground like a monster's flames.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The tree right beside me had nothing but dead leaves on it, though it was still spring.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Its branches spread out firmly, and it looked like quite a young tree, but had the giant cherries sucked all its nourishment dry?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Touch this outside air, and a human dies.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And when cherry petals touch the body, they melt it away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This is a fact I witnessed with my own eyes―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">a story that sounds like a lie but really happens.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But breathing this air doesn't hurt me, and I feel nothing when the petals touch me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Am I no longer human?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Just before the Megasawa City case happened, I used Droga as a test and made an inhuman strength my own, if only for a while.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Yes, at that moment I stopped being human.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I became a monster in human form.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> needed protecting, granted―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">our family needed protecting from the Arata settlement, granted, but I truly meant to commit murder.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But before that―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">just as I took a deep breath and was about to inject the Droga to carry it out―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Someone killed the target.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Yes, I truly meant to do it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I just happened to be beaten to it by someone else.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If that person hadn't been there, I would have been the one who did it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I am―at heart, no different from a murderer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Body and soul, I became a monster back then.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">To begin with, if I had contacted the target and their parents beforehand and told them to stay home that day because a life was in danger, the case would never have happened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Then I could have made the excuse to </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> that the target's routine had changed and I couldn't carry it out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There were any number of ways to avoid it...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Gunshots?</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "181" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ホラー.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">From somewhere above came dry sounds like gunshots, again and again.</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\銃声4発.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Loud bangs, over and over, as if tearing through this foggy, damp air.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I've never heard real gunshots, but what else could this be?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There's no doubt that someone with a gun is there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I got to my feet, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="むち">drove</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> this old body on, and climbed the slope.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow2早い.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Someone is there, more than one person at least.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The only ones that come to mind are the government's special unit.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Which means―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Considering the Nanashina Incident, the special unit will be armed, at the very least, don't you think? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If things go badly, we could have a small war on our hands..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I don't know whether they'd capture </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and the others or kill them, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you two</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had better not go out tomorrow either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If you're discovered as people the toxic gas doesn't affect, there's no telling what they'd do to you."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\タイヤの跡2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the special unit are killing each other...!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> could become a target for killing too...!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That... that has to be stopped, whatever it takes!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Laying a hand on my daughters? Never...!</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow2早い.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
